 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Integer set. add/remove return whether the set changed; a re-added value moves to the end of insertion order. getIterator snapshots the current members in insertion order and returns an id (0, 1, ...); hasNext/next walk that snapshot, unaffected by later changes. Iterator objects are modelled as integer handles so the trace stays JSON. next is only called when hasNext is true.",
  "provenance": [
